# ===========================================================================
# PRUNED 2026-07-27 to the dependency closure of the merge gate's build
# target, case_study/RiscvPmp/CFGVer/Results.vo (101 files).
#
# Everything outside that closure is COMMENTED OUT with a leading `#`, not
# deleted -- restore a line by removing the `#` and re-running
# `coq_makefile -f _CoqProject -o Makefile.coq`.
#
# Why: `make -f Makefile.coq` (no explicit target) used to build MinimalCaps,
# BlockVer/BinaryBlockVer, FemtoKernel and test/, none of which CFGVer needs.
# MinimalCaps in particular does not currently compile in this tree
# (MinimalCaps/Sig.v: "Signature components for field 𝑷_inst do not match"),
# so a plain `make` failed for reasons entirely unrelated to CFGVer and
# masked real errors. BlockVer is no longer used.
#
# NOTE: BlockVer shares case_study/RiscvPmp/Machine.v with CFGVer, so a
# Machine.v change is no longer checked against it. That is intended -- see
# the model-change disclaimer above fun_bool_to_bits in Machine.v -- but if
# BlockVer is ever revived, re-enable its lines and rebuild.
# ===========================================================================

